SHIONTHEBRUISER-SHION_ENERGY_BALL.descri:
Deal {CalculatedDamage:diff()} damage.
[gold]Galvanised 1:[/gold] Deals {ExtraDamage:diff()} additional damage, then regain {VigorRefundPercent:diff()}% of the [gold]Vigor[/gold] consumed.{InCombat:
(Regain {VigorRefund:diff()} [gold]Vigor[/gold])|}

SHIONTHEBRUISER-SLAL_WALL_OF_TEXT.descri:
Apply [gold]Confusion[/gold] to a random enemy equal to the number of cards in your [gold]Discard Pile[/gold].{InCombat:
(Apply {DebuffAmount:diff()} [gold]Confusion[/gold])|}{IfUpgraded:show:
Shuffle this card into your [gold]Draw Pile[/gold].|}

SHIONTHEBRUISER-SLAL_LOGIC_SHIFT.descrip:
Gain [gold]Block[/gold] equal to {IfUpgraded:show:twice |}your [gold]Random[/gold].{InCombat:
(Gain {CalculatedBlock:diff()} [gold]Block[/gold])|}
Add [gold]{IfUpgraded:show:Maybe Later+|Maybe Later}[/gold] into your [gold]Hand[/gold].

SHIONTHEBRUISER-SLAL_CARTOON_STRIKE.desc:
Deal damage equal to your [gold]Random[/gold].{InCombat:
(Deal {CalculatedDamage:diff()} damage)|}
Apply [gold]Weak[/gold] equal to your [gold]Random[/gold].

SHIONTHEBRUISER-SLAL_DICE_SHOTGUN.descri:
Gain [gold]Random[/gold] equal to the number of cards in your [gold]Hand[/gold].{InCombat:
(Gain {RandomGain:diff()})|}
Deal damage equal to your [gold]Random[/gold] to ALL enemies.

SHIONTHEBRUISER-SLAL_KICKSTART_EVENT.des:
Fill your [gold]Hand[/gold] with [gold]Steady[/gold] [gold]{IfUpgraded:show:Fresh Idea+|Fresh Idea}[/gold].
Deal damage and apply [gold]Confusion[/gold] to ALL enemies equal to the number of cards created this way.{InCombat:
(Deal {CalculatedDamage:diff()} damage)|}

SHIONTHEBRUISER-SLAL_NEXT_TOPIC.descript:
Put ALL [gold]Fresh Ideas[/gold] from your [gold]Exhaust Pile[/gold] into your [gold]Discard Pile[/gold].
ALL enemies lose that much HP.{InCombat:
(Lose {HpLossAmount:diff()} HP)|}

SHIONTHEBRUISER-SLAL_AVATAR_CHARACTER.de:
Deal damage and apply [gold]Confusion[/gold] equal to the number of Powers you played this combat.{InCombat:
(Deal {CalculatedDamage:diff()} damage)|}
Add a copy of each of those Powers into your [gold]Discard Pile[/gold].

SHIONTHEBRUISER-SLAL_BREAK_CONTINUITY.de:
Apply [gold]Confusion[/gold] to ALL enemies equal to the number of cards in your [gold]Discard Pile[/gold].{InCombat:
(Apply {DebuffAmount:diff()} [gold]Confusion[/gold])|}
Swap your [gold]Draw Pile[/gold] and [gold]Discard Pile[/gold].
